Changes More Roles Plus applies to Il2CppInterop before building it for the package.
Base: https://github.com/Pietrodjaowjao/Il2CppInterop/commit/f1627d60efc218e4861bacc1239267f96f32ee2c (LGPL-3.0)
- MemoryUtils: call VirtualQuery through a local P/Invoke instead of TerraFX.Interop.Windows, which BepInEx
  does not ship; stop the region walk on an empty region or when it makes no progress; return early from
  FindSignatureInBlock when the block or the pattern cannot match.
- Class_FromIl2CppType_Hook: pass a null type straight to the original function.
The guards and the null check match the behaviour of the build by Pietrodjaowjao that Endless Host Roles
shipped (packaging/il2cppinterop at Gurge44/EndlessHostRoles@c2e0b297e), whose source is not published.

